#. module: ai_website_sale
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai_website_sale.ai_prompt_enhance_product_image_image
msgid ""
"1. If an image is provided (<span data-ai-field=\"image_1024\">image_1024</"
"span>):\n"
"    - Ask the user what changes they would like to make. \n"
"    - Provide a few concise example options inspired by the image (e.g., "
"lighting, time of day, motion blur, color temperature, background, etc.). \n"
"    - The response must be **a list of 3 recommended changes**.\n"
"    - Keep it **very concise and direct**.\n"
"        \n"
"2. If no image is provided:\n"
"    - Ask the user to provide an image.\n"
"    - Ask them to mention the enhancements they would like.\n"
"\n"
"Example (image provided):\n"
"    What changes would you like to make to this image?\n"
"    - time of day.\n"
"    - motion blur amount.\n"
"    - background style.\n"
"Example (no image):\n"
"    Please provide an image and tell me what enhancement you would like to "
"see in the image."
msgstr ""
"1. Jika gambar disertakan (<span data-ai-field=\"image_1024\">image_1024</"
"span>):\n"
"    - Tanya user perubahan apa yang ingin ia lakukan. \n"
"    - Berikan beberapa opsi contoh singkat yang terinspirasi dari gambar "
"(misalnya pencahayaan, waktu, blur gerakan, temperatur warna, latar "
"belakang, dll.). \n"
"    - Tanggapan harus berupa **daftar 3 rekomendasi perubahan**.\n"
"    - Pastikan tanggapan **sangat ringkas dan langsung ke intinya**.\n"
"        \n"
"2. Jika tidak ada gambar yang disertakan:\n"
"    - Minta user untuk menyertakan gambar.\n"
"    - Minta user untuk menyebutkan pemolesan yang diinginkan.\n"
"\n"
"Contoh (gambar disertakan):\n"
"    Perubahan apa yang ingin Anda lakukan pada gambar ini?\n"
"    - waktu.\n"
"    - tingkat blur gerakan.\n"
"    - gaya latar belakang.\n"
"Contoh (tanpa gambar):\n"
"    Sertakan gambar dan beri tahu pemolesan yang ingin Anda lihat pada "
"gambar tersebut."

